ers/Meorge/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112617#pullrequestreview-3445181813","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112617","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112617#pullrequestreview-3445181813"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112617"}},"submitted_at":"2025-11-10T21:15:57Z","commit_id":null},{"id":4074860270,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7y4W7u","user":{"login":"AdriaandeJongh","id":5611323,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2MTEzMjM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5611323?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh","html_url":"https://github.com/AdriaandeJongh","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Tried this PR, works as expected. Didn't look at the code.\n\nMy only worry is a nitpicky one, and not a hill I'd die on: by using `em` we are very much conceptually connecting this with CSS which is… a little meh :P perhaps we can rename it to something else? maybe the image unit can be called 'relative to font size' and the inline abbreviation `rfs` or `fs` like so: `[img height=1.2fs]{path}[/img]`?","state":"APPROVED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112617#pullrequestreview-4074860270","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112617","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112617#pullrequestreview-4074860270"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112617"}},"submitted_at":"2026-04-08T11:50:26Z","commit_id":"c309339ec6b3d1c17ef9e49b27306e30e721a182"},{"id":4077490418,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7zCZDy","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?u=68d23e7ee9cdf810da125e8510b72f845b9dccc8&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Tested locally (rebased on top of `master` https://github.com/godotengine/godot/commit/9273a6a9a04d12299f05aa34606a1c386a00deda), it works as expected. Code looks good to me.\n\nI've also tested combinations like `width=2em` and `height=10%`, which is unusual, but works as you'd expect.\n\nThis is particularly useful for button prompts, which are often embedded in text but can be found at different sizes depending on which text they appear in. However, note that DPITexture oversampling is not aware of the different sizing, so the icon can appear a little blurry at high font sizes (or grainy at low font sizes if the icon's base scale is high and mipmaps are disabled). https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/7411 could help reduce blurriness when mipmaps are enabled.\n\nI think it's fine to use `em` as a unit in the end. While BBCode forums often supported `%` for font sizes relative to `100%`, this created an ambiguity with image widths and deviated from web development standards.\n\nI couldn't test this in tandem with https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116791 due to merge conflicts in that PR. Hopefully, both PRs *should* be able to work together, but this should be tested if that PR is merged first (or vice versa for the other PR).","state":"APPROVED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112617#pullrequestreview-4077490418","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112617","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112617#pullrequestreview-4077490418"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112617"}},"submitted_at":"2026-04-08T18:49:26Z","commit_id":"c309339ec6b3d1c17ef9e49b27306e30e721a182"},{"id":4077567306,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7zCr1K","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?u=2867ee7fcd920bc19b7d1cbf4b10264b9bbc9326&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Code looks good. Breaking change for the scripts feels acceptable in this case, most scripts should work as expected without any changes.","state":"APPROVED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112617#pullrequestreview-4077567306","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112617","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112617#pullrequestreview-4077567306"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112617"}},"submitted_at":"2026-04-08T19:00:03Z","commit_id":"c309339ec6b3d1c17ef9e49b27306e30e721a182"}]